+# Performance history
+
+## Real transcript ingest
+
+No measured figures are available. This repository does not contain a real
+Claude Code transcript to ingest, and this session's sandbox only allows
+access to the current working directory, so the transcript path referenced by
+the smoke test in `crates/muninn-capture/src/lib.rs` (`~/.claude/projects/...`)
+could not be read.
+
+That smoke test (`parses_real_transcripts_when_present`, in the same file)
+would report per-transcript turn count, episode count, and tool-call count via
+`eprintln!` when run against a real transcript file, but it does not measure
+file size in MB or wall-clock ingest time, and no prior run's output is
+recorded anywhere in this repository.
+
+Figures for size (MB), turn count, episode count, and ingest duration should
+be added here only once an actual ingest of a real transcript has been run
+and its output captured.
